#41099
Pull bar teleporter~
2 c 100
pull~
* command script for room 41099
%echoaround% %actor% You here a click as %actor.name% pulls on the bar.
%send% %actor% You hear a click as the bar moves.
%echoaround% %actor% %actor.name% fades from your view.
%send% %actor% Your body is jerked so hard that your teeth rattle!
%teleport% %actor% 40300
%echoaround% %actor% %actor.name% drops from the sky.
%send% %actor% You land face down in the dirt.
%force% %actor% look
~
$~
